# 06 Home Services Platform

## Overview

Develop a platform where users can find, book, and review local service providers.

## Core Features

* Service provider profiles
* Service categories
* Search and filtering
* Booking
* Availability management
* Reviews and ratings
* Customer history
* Service provider dashboard

## Possible Extensions

* Location-based matching
* Price estimation
* Provider recommendations
* Automated customer support
* Service demand analysis

## Suggested Difficulty

Intermediate
